                                "sense_id": "817e13d2-aea6-3e04-8190-3f46254170dc",
                                "text": "\"The gay community would love to point to Patti and say, 'She's one of us'\" I have always been intrigued as to what and whom this mythical \"gay community\" we always talk about consists of. […] Nevertheless, since I assume I am included in this misappellation, I protest the statement I have mentioned, as well as others like it."
